'''Colossus Busters''' (超生命体バスターズ, ''Chō Seimeitai Basutāzu'', '''Super-Lifeform Busters''') is one of the Rare Cat Capsule events in Battle Cats. This event contains [[:Category:Colossus Slayer Cats|Colossus Slayer]] Uber Rare Cats from other events.

{{GachaChances
|UberChance = 5%
|SuperChance = 25%
|RareChance = 70%
}}

